# Sample Snowflake agent-activity extract. One JSON object per line; '#' ignored.
#
# Shape: what an extractor gets by joining, on QUERY_ID,
#   SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.QUERY_HISTORY                         (who / what / cost / status / AGENT_TYPE)
#   SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.ACCESS_HISTORY                        (objects touched / AGENTS_INFO)
#   SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.CORTEX_FUNCTIONS_QUERY_USAGE_HISTORY  (model + tokens)
#   SNOWFLAKE.ACCOUNT_USAGE.USERS                                 (USER_TYPE)
# Column names are kept as ACCOUNT_USAGE spells them so the mapping stays legible.
#
# Three provenances live in these rows and the adapter keeps them apart:
#   Snowflake observes - what SQL ran, which objects, status, elapsed, credits
#                      - AND whether an agent invoked it: AGENT_TYPE, AGENTS_INFO
#   the agent states   - QUERY_TAG: which run, which agent, which logical tool
#   the session        - USER_NAME / USER_TYPE, which is an actor, never an agent
#
# Agent identity is never inferred from SQL or from a username. Native identity
# beats the tag when Snowflake names an agent; both are always preserved.
# AGENTS_INFO is ordered nearest-invoker first and kept in that order.
#
# Story: the weekly forecast agent does its Snowflake-side work, strays into HR,
# reads an unclassified landing table, and has a delete refused by RBAC. It
# reaches Snowflake through an agentic OAuth integration, so Snowflake marks it
# EXTERNAL_AGENT with no name and QUERY_TAG supplies the identity. Alongside it,
# a native Cortex agent runs - which Snowflake can name by itself.
#
# Attribution cases covered, by QUERY_ID suffix:
#   11001-11008, 11011  EXTERNAL_AGENT, null native name + valid tag -> tag identity
#   11009               AGENT_TYPE null, AGENTS_INFO null            -> not agentic, dropped
#   11010               EXTERNAL_AGENT + malformed tag               -> agentic, unidentifiable, dropped
#   11012               USE                                          -> unsupported QUERY_TYPE, dropped
#   11020               CORTEX_AGENT named + tag                     -> native identity wins, tag kept
#   11021               CORTEX_AGENT named, no tag                   -> native identity, run = QUERY_ID
#   11022               CORTEX_LITE_AGENT, no name, no tag           -> agentic, unidentifiable, dropped
#   11023               CORTEX_LITE_AGENT, no name, tag              -> native type + tag identity
#   11024               ordered chain: lite nearest, named parent    -> identity from parent, order kept
